ODW9502 [*] `odoo.osv.expression.AND` is deprecated since Odoo 19.0. Use `Domain.AND` instead.
 --> deprecated_osv_expression.py:7:1
  |
6 | # Fixable: a pure forwarder to a `Domain` attribute.
7 | expression.AND([domain, [("state", "=", "draft")]])
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
8 | expression.OR([domain, [("state", "=", "draft")]])
9 | expression.TRUE_DOMAIN
  |
help: Replace with `Domain.AND`
  |
4 | from odoo.osv.expression import AND, OR, TRUE_DOMAIN, is_leaf, normalize_domain
5 + from odoo.fields import Domain
6 |
7 | # Fixable: a pure forwarder to a `Domain` attribute.
  - expression.AND([domain, [("state", "=", "draft")]])
8 + Domain.AND([domain, [("state", "=", "draft")]])
9 | expression.OR([domain, [("state", "=", "draft")]])
  |
note: This is an unsafe fix and may change runtime behavior

